{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-01_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-01","title":"抢夺目标","storyCode":"10-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0e7bb637c2c6c2466132f8baedded3e83225b42c6b3e7c2d20d67da03a7f4241","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:25 A.M. 天气/阴\n距离伦蒂尼姆十公里，荒地车道"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯信号消失前，黑钢的飞行器就在前方一百米左右的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等我用望远镜确定下具体方位——等等，你怎么站起来了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你闻到烟味了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你手里的铁疙瘩吧，飞行器肯定就在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不用先确认下敌人数量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最多不超过三十个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这也是你闻出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么乱七八糟的呢？出发之前，摩根跟我说了，他们小队一般三十人一组。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对，Misery传回来的情报就是这么说的。按照敌人的习惯，附近应该还有另外两支小队，他们之间会相互支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，他们还真把这里当自家地盘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别冲动。阿米娅说了，在进伦蒂尼姆之前，我们不能闹出太大动静，有那么多势力的眼睛盯着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白轮，你在小兔子的队里，跟我们一块行动几天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"从离舰开始算，有五天了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道从推进之王来到格拉斯哥帮，到她成为我的主子，一共花了多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两天。她只用了两天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一天，她打架赢了我。第二天，我们一块打架赢了另一伙不怀好意的莱塔尼亚佬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，我们就是过命的交情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽说合作时间还不算长，但我很信任你的能力，因陀罗干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。走吧，我们跟上达格达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达已经行动了？！你是说那道突然蹿过去的黑影......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚入伙的时候她还老惦记着什么骑士架子，现在一有架打冲得比谁都快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得跟紧一点，要不然架都被她一个人打完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达出手精准，她一定会从飞行器的侧面翻到顶上去。我们从背面绕，把周围的人清一清，然后突击飞行器的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，我会给你打掩护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干完这一架，你也是我们的好兄弟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按罗德岛的规矩该怎么说来着......想起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救援目标，伦蒂尼姆市民一人，黑钢驾驶员一人。敌方目标——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——深池。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，坐规矩些，别想偷偷摸摸地碰发报机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别、别杀我！我只是手麻了，想稍微活动两下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别使那么大力气，万一真把这人弄死了，回去怎么跟长官交代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，我们的目标是这个人，弄走这台会飞的载具只是顺便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道怎么让它动起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就不该一进来就把驾驶员弄死！依我看，还是别在这里浪费时间了，把这人带回去，这台飞不起来的破载具就留着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面这条路上都是我们的人，再待一会也没什么吧？萨卡兹在城内，大公爵的军队都驻扎在附属地块的军营里，不会有人来找我们麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先、先生们，你们不是萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没长眼睛吗？我们怎么可能会是那种脏东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脏、脏东西......呵呵......您说得对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，除了问话以外，别跟这伦蒂尼姆人交谈。这小子敢背叛萨卡兹，说不定有些来头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，谨慎一点好。你动作快一点，我出去看看外面的人的情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才是不是有什么动静？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我的心跳声音太大了......我什么都听不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们被袭击了？！顶上有东西——M-709，你在外面看到了吗？M-709？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色的......利爪？是荒地野兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对！是——特殊武器！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全体注意，有敌人躲在飞行器顶上！敌人正在......正在撕开顶部的金属——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你挡下了我的一击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情报是准确的，你们不是什么荒野上的强盗。维多利亚教养了你，就是为了让你反手捅刀子的吗，士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......你挺强的。你在为魔族佬干活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种侮辱......足以让我对你发起十次决斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池的士兵，你记住，我们会把伦蒂尼姆从篡夺者的手中取回来。无论是那些萨卡兹，还是你们这些叛徒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留给你们肆意妄为的时间不多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈......瞧瞧你那不可一世的架子，你是贵族的人，你们还在......苟延残喘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你也想要这个从萨卡兹手里逃出来的胆小鬼，想要他身上的情报——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......突然换了攻击目标？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救、救命啊！救救我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别碰他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......假动作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙小人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说过多少次了，打架的时候，要多注意别人的花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来得太慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不是因为我帮你清理了一圈外面的小喽啰？喂，你告诉她，刚才外面有多少人，七个，还是八个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想跟你比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情可不是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年我们一块出第一个任务，一个雇佣兵从你手上逃了回去，你愣是摆了三天臭脸，我和摩根都以为你生了什么重病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚的脸色就跟那时候一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当时的事是我的责任，而且，那已经过去很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......你们......到底是哪来的？我看那个黑衣服的，还以为她是贵族骑士，但你出手怎么跟个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟个街头混混似的？哈，眼神不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧时间。这人不弱，比外面那些被你击倒的都要强一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在萨卡兹和公爵部队的夹缝中活动自如，甚至控制住了部分进出伦蒂尼姆的要道，深池并非散兵游勇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要尽快救出目标，回到安全区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。“留给你们肆意妄为的时间不多了”，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想放狠话的话，这还不够狠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记不记得我怎么教你的？应该说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想哭着求饶命的话，趁现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......M-701请求支援......蔓德拉长官......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，因陀罗，有敌人靠近，建议撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，来得挺快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你负责侦察，没发现附近还有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦，来多少收拾多少不就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......白轮，麻烦隐蔽好自己。进来的敌人，我和因陀罗处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们在里面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士们，救、救命！我可不想再落到他们手里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，别出声，躲里面一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，我们只用带回目标就行，对吧？那把这大铁疙瘩拆了，应该也没什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这话等回去以后，你跟推进之王说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
